<div class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden">
  <section class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460317442991-0ec209397118?q=80&w=1800&auto=format&fit=crop"
        alt="Façades d'immeubles en ville"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col items-center px-6 pt-24 pb-40 md:pb-32 text-center">
      <h1 class="max-w-5xl font-serif text-5xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-7xl">
        L'immobilier,
        <span class="text-emerald-400">lisible en quelques clics.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <%= link_to "Analyser mon bien gratuitement", new_property_path, class: "rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/30 transition hover:bg-emerald-400" %>
        <%= link_to "Comment ça marche ?", about_path, class: "rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:bg-white/15" %>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-4">

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-black/25 p-8 text-left shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-black/30" style="width:320px; height:320px; flex-shrink:0; overflow:hidden;">
          <div class="mb-4 flex justify-center text-5xl">🗂️</div>
          <h3 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-white">Que de paperasse !</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-8 text-white/80">DPE, PV d'AG, devis, etc., mais aussi des dizaines de dispositifs peu connus : être propriétaire, c'est faire face à beaucoup de complexité.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-center py-2 md:hidden">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-10 w-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70"></div>
            <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-300"></div>
            <div class="h-10 w-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center" style="margin-top:140px; flex-shrink:0;">
          <div class="h-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70" style="width:40px;"></div>
          <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-300" style="box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(110,231,183,0.9); flex-shrink:0;"></div>
          <div class="h-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70" style="width:40px;"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-emerald-400/35 bg-emerald-500/20 p-8 text-left shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-emerald-500/25" style="width:320px; height:320px; flex-shrink:0; overflow:hidden;">
          <div class="mb-4 flex justify-center text-5xl">🧠</div>
          <h3 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-white">Lotys clarifie tout</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-8 text-white/85">Lotys lit vos documents, analyse vos photos, repère les aides et propose plusieurs scénarios : rénover, louer, vendre, optimiser ou financer.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-center py-2 md:hidden">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-10 w-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70"></div>
            <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-300"></div>
            <div class="h-10 w-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center" style="margin-top:140px; flex-shrink:0;">
          <div class="h-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70" style="width:40px;"></div>
          <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-300" style="box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(110,231,183,0.9); flex-shrink:0;"></div>
          <div class="h-[2px] bg-emerald-300/70" style="width:40px;"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-black/25 p-8 text-left shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-black/30" style="width:320px; height:320px; flex-shrink:0; overflow:hidden;">
          <div class="mb-4 flex justify-center text-5xl">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-white">Enchères inversées</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-8 text-white/80">Vous pouvez publier anonymement vos besoins et ce sont les professionnels qui viennent vers vous, avec des propositions adaptées.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render "shared/footer", variant: :overlay %>
</div>
